# 【路徑 B:JMX exporter】Prometheus 官方的 Java agent(從 Maven Central 下載、校驗 SHA-1),每個 broker 與 controller 在 7778 埠開 /metrics。只匯出告警需要的 MBean(config/jmx/kafka.yml),不匯出全部
$ JVM 參數 -javaagent:…=7778:kafka.yml;curl <節點>:7778/metrics
▶ 確認 6 個節點都開了 JMX exporter(HTTPS + Basic 帳密),而且關鍵指標都在
agent:jmx_prometheus_javaagent 1.0.1,SHA-1 f9c53eb0aa1828c3c9cd7647238563e43a4ed68c(下載時已與 Maven Central 的 .sha1 比對)
JVM 參數(broker1):KAFKA_OPTS=-Ddemo.cpsec=1 -javaagent:/opt/jmx/jmx_prometheus_javaagent.jar=7778:/opt/jmx/kafka_broker_tls.yml
  broker1:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 13231 個 kafka_ 指標
  broker2:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 13155 個 kafka_ 指標
  broker3:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 13007 個 kafka_ 指標
  controller1:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 974 個 kafka_ 指標
  controller2:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 973 個 kafka_ 指標
  controller3:7778(HTTPS + Basic)→ 962 個 kafka_ 指標
broker1 的關鍵指標:
  kafka_server_replicamanager_underminisrpartitioncount 0.0
  kafka_server_replicamanager_underreplicatedpartitions 0.0
controller1 的關鍵指標:
  kafka_controller_kafkacontroller_activecontrollercount 0.0
  kafka_controller_kafkacontroller_offlinepartitionscount 0.0
判定:6 個節點都開了 JMX exporter(7778 埠,HTTPS + Basic 帳密),URP、離線分區、active controller 等關鍵指標都在
